  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Going to Scotland**: back after 82 archived shows (1310 days); rare: 12 archived performances [2]\n- **Shave My Eyebrows**: rare: 3 archived performances [2]\n- **This Is Heaven**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Crowd Noise & Welcome Back Matt**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Alpha Rats Nest**: back after 39 archived shows (513 days) [2]\n- **Mark On You**: rare: 6 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tmg2023-02-18.LexingtonKY** (recommended): source not stated; 25 songs; 109 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Stage talk about: Crowd Noise, False Starts & [1]\n- Initial sound failure required Travis to rewire equipment, prompting John to restart the intro [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tmg2023-02-18.LexingtonKY**: taped by Cate G; transferred by Cate G; source: Google Pixel 7 [1]. Also: Recorded using a Google Pixel 7 smartphone positioned at the front row center [1]",
